     4| * Long-running background service that polls the durable task queue
     5| * (ivx_owner_ai_tasks) for senior-dev tasks, claims them, executes the full
     6| * engineering pipeline, and writes proof back to the ledger.
     7| *
     8| * Runs independently of the Rork browser. It needs:
     9| *   - SUPABASE_URL + SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY (task queue + proof ledger)
    10| *   - GITHUB_TOKEN + GITHUB_REPO_URL (clone, branch, commit, push)
    11| *   - RENDER_API_KEY + RENDER_SERVICE_ID (deploy, poll)
    12| *   - AI gateway credentials (Vercel AI Gateway) for reasoning
    13| */
